    # 'struct'". Upstream's test is `[(); size_of::<&Self>()]` / `[(); foo::<&'a ()>()]`,
    # so neither annotated half has a shape here. To make it a row: it is a LANGUAGE
    # feature request, not a defect — decide with the owner whether const-expression array
    # lengths are wanted at all before this is priced.

